# Gmail credentials for contact form (REQUIRED for contact form to work)
GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-gmail-app-specific-password

# reCAPTCHA credentials (REQUIRED for contact form spam protection)
